# Copy to .env.local for local overrides; set the same name in Vercel > Project > Environment Variables.
#
# VITE_API_URL: absolute origin of the Express API, with no trailing slash and no "/api".
#   Example: https://your-api.onrender.com
# The client appends "/api" itself. The API's CLIENT_ORIGIN must include this site's origin (CORS).
#
# Leave it unset in local development: requests go to same-origin "/api", which the Vite dev
# server proxies to http://127.0.0.1:5000 (see vite.config.js).
# VITE_API_URL=
